xnu 0474: premap parf and phy, the last maps in the cold link

Measured 2026-11-26 (0473 boot): the worker prints `pcie0 gdsc up` and stops.
The next statement is `wifi_map_host()`, which maps PARF and PHY -- the only two
windows the premap did not cover -- so this is the same class of stall as
0469/0471: an `ml_io_map()` taken from the worker.

Both are mapped on the boot thread with the rest, and the premap line prints
their virtual addresses too.
